# BF2026 R129 — ONLY absolute stage-private paths. No keys, GetCourse field IDs or proofs in git.
# Both order fields and Process ID are UNKNOWN. Keep these paths unset in actual stage.
# If an independently authorized UI owner verifies native Order field IDs,
# supplies actual Order form population readbacks, the Process ID, exact
# variables + ISO8601 timestamp evidence, sign the complete config offline
# using a separately owner-held Ed25519 private key.
# Files must be owner-owned, mode 0600, in the existing stage private-credentials directory.
BF2026_R129_OWNER_SIGNED_CONFIG_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/r129-order-fields.signed.json
BF2026_R129_OWNER_PUBLIC_KEY_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/r129-order-fields.owner-public.pem
# The existing GetCourse Process callback requires a distinct owner-private bearer secret,
# BF2026_R127_CALLBACK_SECRET_FILE, which is NOT a GetCourse provider digital signature.
# Explicit one-shot migration registration is off by default; do not enable while the
# actual native field IDs/process ID are unknown.
BF2026_STAGE_ONLY=1
BF2026_R129_APPLY_OWNER_CONFIG=0
BF2026_STAGE_PG_POOL_MODULE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/stage-pool-module.cjs
# Registration, even if enabled, ONLY creates QA attestation state, never sales readiness.
